add('memory','weekend_cabin_boundary',
('For the cabin weekend, I am happy to share a bedroom with my sister, but I do not want a shared bathroom.','Sharing a bedroom with your sister is acceptable; a shared bathroom is not.'),
('The first listing has two beds and a private bathroom.','That matches the room-sharing and bathroom preferences you described.'),
('What does en suite mean?','It means a bathroom is directly connected to a bedroom.'),
('Does that word alone tell us how many beds there are?','No. It describes the bathroom arrangement, not the number of beds.'),
('Another listing has separate bedrooms but a communal bathroom. Is that better for my stated needs?','No. Separate bedrooms do not resolve your objection to a shared bathroom.'),
('Which kind of sharing did I agree to?','Sharing a bedroom with your sister.'))
